{
  "content_version": "story-v1.0-phase2",
  "npcs": [
    {
      "npc_id": "npc_laozhou",
      "display_name": "老周",
      "opening_node_id": "node.laozhou.opening",
      "allowed_evidence_ids": ["E01", "E02", "E03", "E04", "E05"],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_id": "node.laozhou.opening",
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.opening.laozhou",
          "text": "这封从旧库搬过两回。我来对号，你来签。先看表背，失物只认号。",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt.laozhou.ask_b01",
              "label": "问站台那晚的照明",
              "kind": "topic",
              "target_node_id": "node.laozhou.b01"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt.laozhou.repeat_b01",
              "label": "再问站台那晚的照明",
              "kind": "topic",
              "target_node_id": "node.laozhou.b01",
              "condition": {
                "requires_disclosure_ids": ["D01"]
              }
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt.laozhou.leave",
              "label": "结束对话",
              "kind": "end"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "node_id": "node.laozhou.b01",
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.B01.initial",
          "text": "站台那晚在我印象里一直亮着。我还把那盏油灯拖到里头去了。",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt.laozhou.b01.back",
              "label": "先不问这个",
              "kind": "topic",
              "target_node_id": "node.laozhou.opening"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt.laozhou.b01.leave",
              "label": "结束对话",
              "kind": "end"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "disclosures": [
        {
          "disclosure_id": "D01",
          "kind": "testimony",
          "required_evidence_ids": ["E02"],
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.D01.laozhou",
          "text": "进水，二十一点十七。我的灯到二十才摆好。是黑过，中间那点我记混了。"
        },
        {
          "disclosure_id": "D02",
          "kind": "verification",
          "required_evidence_ids": ["E03", "E04"]
        },
        {
          "disclosure_id": "D03",
          "kind": "testimony",
          "required_evidence_ids": ["E01", "E05"],
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.D03.laozhou",
          "text": "她抓住小姑娘的胳膊，表掉到台沿。我弯腰拣的时候指针已经不动了，冠头是歪的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "npc_id": "npc_linyao",
      "display_name": "林遥",
      "opening_node_id": "node.linyao.opening",
      "allowed_evidence_ids": ["E01", "E03", "E04"],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_id": "node.linyao.opening",
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.opening.linyao",
          "text": "公告上有一张我妈留的领取凭号。我把原来的带来了。表还在吗？",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt.linyao.ask_other",
              "label": "问表以外的事",
              "kind": "topic",
              "target_node_id": "node.linyao.refusal"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt.linyao.leave",
              "label": "结束对话",
              "kind": "end"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "node_id": "node.linyao.refusal",
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.linyao.refusal",
          "text": "表的事按签单。别的今天先别问。",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt.linyao.refusal.back",
              "label": "回到表的事",
              "kind": "topic",
              "target_node_id": "node.linyao.opening"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt.linyao.refusal.leave",
              "label": "结束对话",
              "kind": "end"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "disclosures": [
        {
          "disclosure_id": "REC.engraving",
          "kind": "recognition",
          "required_evidence_ids": ["E01"],
          "requires_observed_field_ids": ["watch.back_engraving"],
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.linyao.engraving",
          "text": "四月十二是我妈的生日，九月十六是我的。那个点，我小时候摸得到。柜里究竟是不是那一只，你得对上号。"
        },
        {
          "disclosure_id": "D02",
          "kind": "testimony",
          "required_evidence_ids": ["E03", "E04"],
          "content_ref": "dialogue.CH01.D02.linyao",
          "text": "沈禾，是我妈妈。这个号和她放在家里那张一样。她写着要我自己领。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
